---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
---

<ProjectLayout
  title="Coaching Sync & Square Billing Pipeline"
  description="Self-hosted operations service on Raspberry Pi 4 syncing Google Calendar coaching sessions through a SQLite state machine and LAN review gate to Square Invoices."
  canonicalPath="/projects/coaching-payment-tracker"
  category="Operations & Workflow Automation"
  summary="Local-first Python and SQLite service running on a Raspberry Pi 4 that reconciles completed Google Calendar coaching sessions into staged Square invoices behind a one-click LAN approval gate."
  stack={['Python · FastAPI', 'Google Calendar API', 'SQLite WAL', 'Square Invoices API', 'Raspberry Pi 4']}
  liveUrl="#staging-demo"
  liveLabel="Try Staging Gate Demo ↓"
  secondaryUrl="/#contact"
  secondaryLabel="Discuss Workflow Automation"
>
  <!-- Grounded Operations Case Study -->
  <section aria-labelledby="case-study-heading" class="section-stack">
    <div class="prose-block">
      <span class="spec-label">Operations Case Study</span>
      <h2 id="case-study-heading">Problem, State Machine &amp; Outcome</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Problem:</strong> Reconciling 1-on-1 coaching sessions manually meant cross-referencing Google Calendar entries, filtering out complimentary intro calls, checking client-specific hourly or package rates, and typing line items into Square. That routine took roughly 45 minutes of error-prone admin work every week.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Architecture:</strong> A systemd timer on a 5-watt Raspberry Pi 4 polls Google Calendar via OAuth 2.0, parses completed session durations, and writes records into a WAL-mode SQLite state machine keyed by <code>UNIQUE(calendar_event_id)</code>. Sessions land in <code>PENDING_REVIEW</code> on a LAN-only FastAPI dashboard before dispatching orders to the Square Invoices API with deterministic idempotency keys.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Outcome:</strong> Eliminated manual monthly and weekly billing reconciliation, cut invoice review to under a minute on the local network, prevented duplicate or missed sessions, and avoided recurring SaaS automation subscriptions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="spec-grid">
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">01 / Ingestion</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">Google Calendar Sync</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">Headless OAuth 2.0 polling parses completed RFC 3339 timestamps and excludes cancelled meetings or <code>[Free Discovery]</code> intros.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">02 / State Machine</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">SQLite WAL Ledger</h3>
        <p class="spec-text"><code>UNIQUE(calendar_event_id)</code> enforces idempotent syncs while resolving each client's agreed hourly or package rate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">03 / Safety Gate</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">LAN Review Dashboard</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">Private FastAPI interface on Raspberry Pi 4 holds every line item for explicit human approval before any invoice is created.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">04 / Billing</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">Square Invoices API</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">Publishes Square Orders with deterministic <code>idempotency_key</code> tokens and writes back <code>square_invoice_id</code> audit references.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Interactive LAN Staging Gate Preview -->
  <section id="staging-demo" class="studio-panel sandbox-panel" aria-labelledby="sandbox-heading">
    <div class="panel-top">
      <div>
        <span class="spec-label">Interactive Client-Side Preview (Sample Data)</span>
        <h2 id="sandbox-heading" class="panel-title">Human-in-the-Loop Staging Gate</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="staged-total mono">
        Staged Batch: <strong id="sandbox-total-amount">$275.00</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="session-list" role="group" aria-label="Sample staged coaching sessions">
      <label class="session-row" for="check-item-1">
        <input type="checkbox" id="check-item-1" class="session-check" checked />
        <div class="session-main">
          <div class="session-top">
            <strong>Alex Rivera</strong>
            <span class="mono session-meta">cal_evt_9a48f2 · 60 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="session-sub">Bi-Weekly Productivity Coaching · Yesterday, 2:00 PM</div>
        </div>
        <div class="session-right mono">
          <span class="session-rate">$150.00</span>
          <span class="session-state pending-state">PENDING_REVIEW</span>
        </div>
      </label>

      <label class="session-row" for="check-item-2">
        <input type="checkbox" id="check-item-2" class="session-check" checked />
        <div class="session-main">
          <div class="session-top">
            <strong>Dr. Elena Vance</strong>
            <span class="mono session-meta">cal_evt_8c11e4 · 45 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="session-sub">Systems Workflow Advisory · Tuesday, 10:00 AM</div>
        </div>
        <div class="session-right mono">
          <span class="session-rate">$125.00</span>
          <span class="session-state pending-state">PENDING_REVIEW</span>
        </div>
      </label>

      <div class="session-row is-excluded" aria-label="Automatically excluded intro call">
        <input type="checkbox" class="session-check" disabled aria-label="Excluded intro session" />
        <div class="session-main">
          <div class="session-top">
            <strong>Marcus Chen</strong>
            <span class="mono session-meta">Filtered · Intro Tag</span>
          </div>
          <div class="session-sub">[Free Discovery] Consultation Intro · Monday, 3:30 PM</div>
        </div>
        <div class="session-right mono">
          <span class="session-rate muted">$0.00</span>
          <span class="session-state muted">EXCLUDED</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sandbox-actions">
      <span class="mono action-hint">Toggle sessions above to test Square batch staging.</span>
      <div class="action-btns">
        <button type="button" id="btn-sandbox-approve" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
          Approve &amp; Stage Square Batch
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="btn-sandbox-reset" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" hidden>
          Reset Preview
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <pre id="sandbox-dispatch-log" class="dispatch-log mono" hidden aria-live="polite"></pre>
  </section>
</ProjectLayout>

<script is:inline>
  (function initStagingSandbox() {
    var check1 = document.getElementById('check-item-1');
    var check2 = document.getElementById('check-item-2');
    var totalEl = document.getElementById('sandbox-total-amount');
    var approveBtn = document.getElementById('btn-sandbox-approve');
    var resetBtn = document.getElementById('btn-sandbox-reset');
    var logEl = document.getElementById('sandbox-dispatch-log');
    var stateEls = document.querySelectorAll('.pending-state');

    function computeState() {
      var total = 0;
      var count = 0;
      var customers = [];
      if (check1 && check1.checked) {
        total += 150;
        count += 1;
        customers.push('CUST_RIVERA_8829');
      }
      if (check2 && check2.checked) {
        total += 125;
        count += 1;
        customers.push('CUST_VANCE_4012');
      }
      if (totalEl) totalEl.textContent = '$' + total.toFixed(2);
      if (approveBtn) {
        approveBtn.disabled = count === 0;
        approveBtn.textContent =
          count === 0 ? 'Select at least 1 session' : 'Approve & Stage Square Batch';
      }
      return { total: total, count: count, customers: customers };
    }

    if (check1) check1.addEventListener('change', computeState);
    if (check2) check2.addEventListener('change', computeState);

    if (approveBtn) {
      approveBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        var st = computeState();
        if (st.count === 0) return;

        if (check1) check1.disabled = true;
        if (check2) check2.disabled = true;
        approveBtn.hidden = true;
        if (resetBtn) resetBtn.hidden = false;

        stateEls.forEach(function (el, idx) {
          var checked = idx === 0 ? check1 && check1.checked : check2 && check2.checked;
          el.textContent = checked ? 'DISPATCHED' : 'SKIPPED';
          el.className = checked ? 'session-state pending-state is-done' : 'session-state pending-state muted';
        });

        if (logEl) {
          logEl.hidden = false;
          logEl.textContent =
            '> idempotency_key: "inv_batch_7f920d3a"\n' +
            '> square_customers: ' +
            st.customers.join(', ') +
            '\n' +
            '> square_orders: ' +
            st.count +
            ' invoice(s) staged · total $' +
            st.total.toFixed(2) +
            '\n' +
            '> sqlite_ledger: state -> INVOICED (reconciled in 0.03s)';
        }
      });
    }

    if (resetBtn) {
      resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        if (check1) {
          check1.disabled = false;
          check1.checked = true;
        }
        if (check2) {
          check2.disabled = false;
          check2.checked = true;
        }
        if (approveBtn) approveBtn.hidden = false;
        resetBtn.hidden = true;
        if (logEl) logEl.hidden = true;

        stateEls.forEach(function (el) {
          el.textContent = 'PENDING_REVIEW';
          el.className = 'session-state pending-state';
        });

        computeState();
      });
    }
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .section-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .prose-block strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .prose-block code,
  .spec-text code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.86em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .sandbox-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .panel-top {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .panel-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .staged-total {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 0.42rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
  }

  .staged-total strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .session-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
  }

  .session-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.95rem 1.1rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 140ms ease;
  }

  .session-row:hover {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
  }

  .session-row.is-excluded {
    opacity: 0.62;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .session-row.is-excluded:hover {
    background: transparent;
  }

  .session-check {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    accent-color: var(--accent);
    cursor: inherit;
  }

  .session-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .session-top {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  .session-meta {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .session-sub {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .session-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .session-rate {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .session-state {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .session-state.is-done {
    color: var(--live-dot);
  }

  .muted {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .sandbox-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .action-hint {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .action-btns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .action-btns button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .dispatch-log {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.95rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .session-row {
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    }

    .session-right {
      grid-column: 2;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-top: 0.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
